{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mortal Shell II is a standalone sequel to Mortal Shell that significantly expands on the original with unrestricted, adrenaline-charged combat, deeper weapon design with extensive upgrade options, and an emphasis on free exploration.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This action-RPG offers an immersive, interconnected open world, expansive yet deliberately compact, designed to unfold its twisted landscapes and hidden structures while respecting the player's time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/f734f39f0cf5ce97328d1add01257b76.poster.avif?t=1771261562\" width=780 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/f734f39f0cf5ce97328d1add01257b76.webm?t=1771261562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/000596eb0b511b29dea5417d0cfe7de5.avif?t=1771261562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/000596eb0b511b29dea5417d0cfe7de5.avif?t=1771261562 width=800 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dormant forms of forgotten warriors are scattered throughout Mortal Shell II\u2019s shattered world. Once discovered, each Shell can be awakened and possessed, unlocking their innate strengths and unique abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your own style of combat by harnessing the diverse unique abilities of each Shell, and unravel their secrets through the discovery of lost memories.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/0da3be340b79db32bc996818ccfd112a.poster.avif?t=1771261562\" width=780 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/0da3be340b79db32bc996818ccfd112a.webm?t=1771261562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/1be5e054e01493ca010030a1b1df74e8.avif?t=1771261562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/1be5e054e01493ca010030a1b1df74e8.avif?t=1771261562 width=800 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mortal Shell II\u2019s compact open-world connects over winding footpaths guarded by the desperate and fanatical. Those who wander are rewarded with new story elements, Shells, powerful and strange weaponry, upgrades, curiosities and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step through derelict temples of ancient deities, across forbidden forests and icy graves, into citadels carved from bone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered between these lost landmarks are more than 60 dungeons, each providing a formidable challenge to the talents and weaponry you have accrued on your way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/eb09789c7cb33d7713e3e5fe351b8828.poster.avif?t=1771261562\" width=780 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/eb09789c7cb33d7713e3e5fe351b8828.webm?t=1771261562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/1c59e361d083d7ee4f11ee83d1593638.avif?t=1771261562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/1c59e361d083d7ee4f11ee83d1593638.avif?t=1771261562 width=800 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Harbinger, a being prophesied to reclaim the blessed Undermether\u2019s stolen Ova from the daunting creatures that ruthlessly guard her unborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mortal Shell II\u2019s combat system is agile yet grounded. Unrestricted by stamina, players exploit multiple tactics to shatter enemy posture and strike critically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/0bf0c3db21d30fb6bfb828f3748370cf.poster.avif?t=1771261562\" width=780 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/0bf0c3db21d30fb6bfb828f3748370cf.webm?t=1771261562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2584270?t=1771261562","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/d5744a9094b1227486bc6df3219f7fbc20b40129/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771261562","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/5a148cdfe243f42470aafa8df94d3e3f1e1fcd9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771261562","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/5a148cdfe243f42470aafa8df94d3e3f1e1fcd9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771261562","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Mortal Shell II contains violence including sword fights with blood sprays, execution maneuvers, and medieval firearms.  "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>BETA REGISTRATION OPENS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/3a4d23a0124a1567edf0f699a7e42dd9.avif?t=1771261562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/3a4d23a0124a1567edf0f699a7e42dd9.avif?t=1771261562 width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mortal Shell II is a standalone sequel to Mortal Shell that significantly expands on the original with unrestricted, adrenaline-charged combat, deeper weapon design with extensive upgrade options, and an emphasis on free exploration.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This action-RPG offers an immersive, interconnected open world, expansive yet deliberately compact, designed to unfold its twisted landscapes and hidden structures while respecting the player's time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/f734f39f0cf5ce97328d1add01257b76.poster.avif?t=1771261562\" width=780 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/f734f39f0cf5ce97328d1add01257b76.webm?t=1771261562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/000596eb0b511b29dea5417d0cfe7de5.avif?t=1771261562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/000596eb0b511b29dea5417d0cfe7de5.avif?t=1771261562 width=800 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dormant forms of forgotten warriors are scattered throughout Mortal Shell II\u2019s shattered world. Once discovered, each Shell can be awakened and possessed, unlocking their innate strengths and unique abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your own style of combat by harnessing the diverse unique abilities of each Shell, and unravel their secrets through the discovery of lost memories.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/0da3be340b79db32bc996818ccfd112a.poster.avif?t=1771261562\" width=780 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/0da3be340b79db32bc996818ccfd112a.webm?t=1771261562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/1be5e054e01493ca010030a1b1df74e8.avif?t=1771261562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/1be5e054e01493ca010030a1b1df74e8.avif?t=1771261562 width=800 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mortal Shell II\u2019s compact open-world connects over winding footpaths guarded by the desperate and fanatical. Those who wander are rewarded with new story elements, Shells, powerful and strange weaponry, upgrades, curiosities and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step through derelict temples of ancient deities, across forbidden forests and icy graves, into citadels carved from bone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered between these lost landmarks are more than 60 dungeons, each providing a formidable challenge to the talents and weaponry you have accrued on your way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/eb09789c7cb33d7713e3e5fe351b8828.poster.avif?t=1771261562\" width=780 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/eb09789c7cb33d7713e3e5fe351b8828.webm?t=1771261562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/1c59e361d083d7ee4f11ee83d1593638.avif?t=1771261562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras_big/1c59e361d083d7ee4f11ee83d1593638.avif?t=1771261562 width=800 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Harbinger, a being prophesied to reclaim the blessed Undermether\u2019s stolen Ova from the daunting creatures that ruthlessly guard her unborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mortal Shell II\u2019s combat system is agile yet grounded. Unrestricted by stamina, players exploit multiple tactics to shatter enemy posture and strike critically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/0bf0c3db21d30fb6bfb828f3748370cf.poster.avif?t=1771261562\" width=780 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/extras/0bf0c3db21d30fb6bfb828f3748370cf.webm?t=1771261562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Cold Symmetry"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584270/2bd90cfa85937aeaffa69a1d892001f6dcaf2576/header.jpg?t=1771261562","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025, Playstack and Cold Symmetry, all rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2584270/1941047265/9fcb0a791c36709c9e2a95f8dd48d442add7cbdd/1750933690/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749243901","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2584270/1941047265/9fcb0a791c36709c9e2a95f8dd48d442add7cbdd/1750933690/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749243901","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2584270/1941047265/9fcb0a791c36709c9e2a95f8dd48d442add7cbdd/1750933690/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749243901","id":257152199,"name":"Mortal Shell II Official Announcement Short","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152199/c21450965823e46901add9381f72cbbaf3079984/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749243901"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2584270/1800605640/14bd2ad8b796a76f077ff4799137a05b4a8c9890/1750933690/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749243905","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2584270/1800605640/14bd2ad8b796a76f077ff4799137a05b4a8c9890/17509336